Package: SIMP
Title: Bayesian Modelling Framework for Constrained Intensity Data
Version: 0.0.1.1
Authors@R:
    person("Gilles", "Colling", , "gilles.colling051@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A general Bayesian modelling framework for bounded, compositional,
    and zero-heavy intensity data. Treats constraints as defining features of
    the data-generating process rather than nuisances to be transformed away.
